{"canonicalText":"\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n\n  Skip to content\n\n  \n    \n\n      🇺🇸 Labor Day: 20% off all tests—save up to $340. Ends Sept 8.\n    Use code LABORDAY26\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n        \n          \n            \n            Close menu\n          \n        \n      \n    \n    \n      \n                    Shop Tests\n                    \n                      \n  \n\n\n                    \n                  \n                \n                  \n                        \n                              Shop All\n                            \n                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                          TruAge™ + TruHealth™ Test\n                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                          TruHealth™ Test\n                            \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                          TruAge™ Test\n              \n                    How It Works\n                    \n                      \n  \n\n\n                    \n                  \n                \n                  \n                        \n                              Our Science\n                            \n                        \n                              About TruAge™\n                            \n                        \n                              About TruHealth™\n                            \n              \n                    For Researchers\n                    \n                      \n  \n\n\n                    \n                  \n                \n                  \n                        \n                              Our Services\n                            \n                        \n                              Algorithms\n                              \n                                \n  \n  \n\n\n                              \n                            \n                            \n                              \n                    