        \n            \n  \n  \n    Search\n    \n      \n      \n      \n        \n        Search\n      \n    \n\n    \n      \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n        \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n\n\n    \n\n      \n        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n            \n            Translation missing: en.products.product.media.zoom\n          \n\n\n      \n\n      \n            \n          \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n\n                \n                  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n                \n\n              \n            \n          \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n        \n\n          \n            \n                      BIOLOGICAL AGING\n\n\n                    TruAge™ Test\n\n\n            \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \nSee how old your body really is — and how fast you're aging.TruAge™  is a medical-grade epigenetic age test — analyzing 1,000,000+ DNA methylation sites from a simple at-home test, developed with science from Harvard, Yale, and Duke. Discover your biological age, your aging speed, and the age of 11 organ systems.\n\n  \n                      \n  75 Longevity Biomarkers\n  Biological aging\n  11 Organ systems\n  Aging speed\n  \n  Personalized recommendations\n\n\n\n                    \n\n\n    \n    \n        The TruAge test includes the following reports:\n        \n        \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Biological Age Score (OMICmAge™)\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    11 Organ Systems Age Scores\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Pace of Aging (DunedinPACE™)\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Telomere Length Report\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    12 Cell Immunity Report\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Inflammation Score (CRP & IL-6)\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Grip Strength & Gait Speed\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Smoking Impact Score\n                \n              \n            \n              \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    Alcohol Impact Score\n                \n              \n            \n            \n              \n                View Sample Report\n              \n            \n         \n        \n        \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                \n                    HSA / FSA Accepted\n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n                \n                    Science from Harvard\n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n                \n                    Comprehensive Testing\n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n                \n                    Easy and Convenient\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n\n                      \n                    \n\n\nLIMITED TIME - 50% OFFAnnual Subscription $249.50 per testIncludes 4 tests  • Renews annually ($998 billed today)  .One-time purchase$499.00\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n\n    \n\n\n    \n  \n    \n      \n        Add to cart\n      \n    \n  \n    \n      \n    \n  \n    \n  \n    \n  \n    \n\n  \n\n  \n\n  \n    \n        \n          Default Title - $499.00 USD\n        \n      \n\n  \n\n\n              \n              \n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                      \n  \n    \n    CLIA-Certified Lab\n  \n  \n    \n    FSA/HSA Eligible\n  \n  \n    \n    Encrypted Data\n  \n  \n    \n    Secure Portal\n  \n\n\n\n                    \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n            \n        \n    \n\n\n  \n  The most complete picture of  how your body is agingOne finger prick,  75+ biomarkers — the full view of how you're aging.75+BiomarkersA look at how your immune system is functioning, plus signs of smoking or alcohol-related risk.11Organ systemsIndividual epigenetic age scores — brain, heart, liver and more.1,000,000+DNA markersBuilt on cutting-edge epigenetic research and developed with world-leading scientists.\n\n\n  \n  What's includedEvery insight inside your TruAge™ report75+ longevity biomarkers, organized into clear, actionable reports — each with personalized recommendations.\n            \n                  \n                OMICmAge™ Biological AgeYour biological age from the most predictive aging algorithm, built with Harvard.\n            \n                  \n                SYMPHONYAge™ Organ AgesEpigenetic age for 11 organ systems, from Yale's system-specific clocks.\n            \n                  \n                DunedinPACE™ Aging SpeedHow fast you're aging right now, compared to a single calendar year.\n            \n                  \n                Telomere LengthThe length of your telomeres — a key marker of cellular aging.\n            \n                  \n                Immune Cell ReportImmune-health markers that reveal how your immune system is aging.\n            \n                  \n                Inflammation ScoreEpigenetic CRP & IL-6 — the hidden inflammation that drives aging.\n            \n                  \n                Epigenetic Biomarkers™Clinical biomarkers — proteins, metabolites and clinical measures — estimated directly from your DNA methylation.\n            \n                  \n                Smoking & Alcohol ImpactHow lifetime smoking and alcohol have shaped your biological age.\n\n\n\n\n  How it worksYour full report in four simple stepsNo clinic visits. No prescription. Just a few drops of blood, collected at home.\n            \nOrder + activateOrder online and your kit ships to your door with everything you need to test at home.\n            Collect your sampleA quick, painless finger-prick — just a few drops of blood, no lab visit required.\n            Mail it backReturn your sample in the prepaid USPS envelope. Our CLIA-certified lab does the rest.\n            Unlock your insightsYour personalized TruAge   report will be ready in your secure results portal within 3–4 weeks after our lab receives your sample.\n\n\n\n\n  Discover your TruAgeSee exactly where you standYour TruAge report turns your epigenetics into a clear picture of how you're aging — and the personalized steps to change it.\n        \n        \n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n        \n      \n        View Sample Report\n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n        Deeper diveGo deeper on the scienceEvery report inside your TruAge results, explained in detail.\n\n        \n          \n    \n      \n      OMICmAge™: Biological Age\n      \n    \n    \n      Discover your biological age through the most advanced and predictive aging algorithm ever created; OMICmAge™, developed by TruDiagnostic™ in partnership with Harvard University.\n      OMICmAge™ is exciting healthcare providers and patients alike because it provides novel insights into the reasons why someone is experiencing advanced aging. Older analysis was limited in the nature of only being able to determine if a patient's age and biological aging was accelerated or decelerated. Now we can not only tell you your biological age, but also what is most likely contributing to an age acceleration!\n      This report includes the following:\n      \n        Your OMICm Biological Age\n        Your Methylation Risk Scores for Various Proteins\n        Your Methylation Risk Scores for Various Metabolites\n        Your Methylation Risk Scores for Clinical Biomarkers\n      \n      PLUS - Discover whether your methylation risk scores for various, multi-omic measurements are correlated with a higher or lower biological age. This report also calculates what your risk of death and disease would be if your biological age increases or decreases by one to several years.\n    \n  \n  \n    \n      \n      DunedinPACE™: Aging Speed\n      \n    \n    \n      Discover how fast or slow your body is currently aging! Results are reported in a fashion that compares your pace of aging to 1 standard calendar year. For example, if your results are '0.8', that means your body is currently aging 0.8 years for each year that passes.\n      In our Pace of Aging report, we use the exclusively-licensed DunedinPACE™ algorithm to calculate your current speed of aging.\n      This algorithm is the product of the on-going and renowned Dunedin Multidisciplinary Health and Development Study, where researchers have followed the lives and aging patterns of 1,037 people born between 1972, and 1973 at Queen Mary Maternity Hospital, in Dunedin, New Zealand.\n      The study is now in its fifth decade and has produced a considerable amount of data that shapes what we know about the pace at which humans age, along with phenotypic expressions of aging; yielding the only 3rd generation aging technology currently available.\n    \n  \n  \n    \n      \n      SYMPHONYAge™: Organ Systems\n      \n    \n    \n      SYMPHONYAge™ is available exclusively through TruDiagnostic™. Access it by purchasing a new TruAge™ COMPLETE test or upgrading a previous COMPLETE analysis.\n      Discover aging insights on eleven organ systems with SYMPHONYAge™, using Yale University's system-specific, epigenetic aging algorithms. TruDiagnostic™ exclusively offers the SYMPHONYAge™ clock series to deliver both individual and interconnected organ aging insights in our new SYMPHONYAge™ report.\n      Upgrade your previous TruAge™ COMPLETE test(s) to gain digital access to the epigenetic age calculations in our SYMPHONYAge™ reports, including age for your SymphonyAge and 11 organ systems:\n      \n        Brain Age\n        Blood Age\n        Heart Age\n        Lung Age\n        Liver Age\n        Hormone Age\n        Metabolic Age\n        Kidney Age\n        Immunity Age\n        Inflammation Age\n        Musculoskeletal Age\n        SymphonyAge\n      \n    \n  \n  \n    \n      \n      Immune Cell Deconvolution\n      \n    \n    \n      The Immune Cell Deconvolution report breaks down the different types of immune cells present in a person's blood, giving insights into how the immune system is functioning.\n      By analyzing the DNA methylation patterns, the report can estimate the proportion of various immune cells (like T-cells, B-cells, and macrophages) and track changes that may indicate immune system aging or dysfunction.\n      This analysis helps in understanding how the immune system is involved in the aging process and its response to lifestyle or medical interventions.\n    \n  \n  \n    \n      \n      Telomere Length\n      \n    \n    \n      Telomeres are an essential part of human cells that affect how our cells age. Telomere length has emerged as an important determinant of replicative senescence and cell fate - an important indicator of the aging process and a wide range of disease states, including cancers, cardiovascular disease, and age-related disorders.\n    \n  \n  \n    \n      \n      Alcohol & Smoking Impact\n      \n    \n    \n      Understand how drinking alcohol speeds up the aging processes of your skin, blood, and liver, as well as how it impacts your overall, biological aging processes.\n      Learn how your lifetime alcohol consumption, as well as current drinking habits, affect your DNA expression. Our Alcohol Consumption report also breaks down the latest research on how long it would take an average person to reverse the damage of drinking, through abstinence.\n      The Smoking Risk report analyzes DNA methylation patterns to assess the impact of smoking on your biological age and long-term health risks.\n      By examining specific biomarkers in your DNA that are influenced by smoking, the report can reveal if smoking—whether current or in the past—has accelerated your biological aging process. This detailed analysis also highlights the potential long-term health consequences associated with smoking, such as increased risks for conditions like cardiovascular disease, lung disease, and cancer.\n      The report provides actionable insights, helping you understand how smoking has affected your health and what lifestyle changes might help mitigate these risks.\n    \n  \n\n        \n      \n\n\n\n\n  CompareWhich test is right for you?Every test runs on a single at-home blood sample. Choose your focus — or get the complete picture.\n    \n      \n        \n          \n            \n                TruAge™\n                $499\n              \n                TruHealth™\n                $499\n              \n                TruAge™ + TruHealth™\n                $849\n              \n        \n        \n              Biomarkers analyzed75+\n105+\n180+\n\n              Biological age · OMICmAge™—\n              Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™—\n              Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™—\n              Telomere length—\n              Immune & inflammation\n              Nutrients & vitamins—\n              Metabolic & energy—\n              Toxins & heavy metals—\n              Neurocognitive markers—\n      \n    \n\n    \n    \n      TruAge™TruHealth™TruAge™ + TruHealth™\n              Biomarkers analyzed\n              75+\n\n            \n              Biological age · OMICmAge™\n              \n            \n              Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n              \n            \n              Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n              \n            \n              Telomere length\n              \n            \n              Immune & inflammation\n              \n            \n              Nutrients & vitamins\n              —\n            \n              Metabolic & energy\n              —\n            \n              Toxins & heavy metals\n              —\n            \n              Neurocognitive markers\n              —\n            \n              Biomarkers analyzed\n              105+\n\n            \n              Biological age · OMICmAge™\n              —\n            \n              Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n              —\n            \n              Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n              —\n            \n              Telomere length\n              —\n            \n              Immune & inflammation\n              \n            \n              Nutrients & vitamins\n              \n            \n              Metabolic & energy\n              \n            \n              Toxins & heavy metals\n              \n            \n              Neurocognitive markers\n              \n            \n              Biomarkers analyzed\n              180+\n\n            \n              Biological age · OMICmAge™\n              \n            \n              Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n              \n            \n              Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n              \n            \n              Telomere length\n              \n            \n              Immune & inflammation\n              \n            \n              Nutrients & vitamins\n              \n            \n              Metabolic & energy\n              \n            \n              Toxins & heavy metals\n              \n            \n              Neurocognitive markers\n              \n            \n\n    \n    \n          \n            TruAge™ $499\n            \n          \n          \n                Biomarkers analyzed\n                75+\n\n              \n                Biological age · OMICmAge™\n                \n              \n                Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n                \n              \n                Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n                \n              \n                Telomere length\n                \n              \n                Immune & inflammation\n                \n              \n                Nutrients & vitamins\n                —\n              \n                Metabolic & energy\n                —\n              \n                Toxins & heavy metals\n                —\n              \n                Neurocognitive markers\n                —\n              \n        \n          \n            TruHealth™ $499\n            \n          \n          \n                Biomarkers analyzed\n                105+\n\n              \n                Biological age · OMICmAge™\n                —\n              \n                Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n                —\n              \n                Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n                —\n              \n                Telomere length\n                —\n              \n                Immune & inflammation\n                \n              \n                Nutrients & vitamins\n                \n              \n                Metabolic & energy\n                \n              \n                Toxins & heavy metals\n                \n              \n                Neurocognitive markers\n                \n              \n        \n          \n            TruAge™ + TruHealth™ $849\n            \n          \n          \n                Biomarkers analyzed\n                180+\n\n              \n                Biological age · OMICmAge™\n                \n              \n                Organ-system ages · SYMPHONYAge™\n                \n              \n                Aging Speed · DunedinPACE™\n                \n              \n                Telomere length\n                \n              \n                Immune & inflammation\n                \n              \n                Nutrients & vitamins\n                \n              \n                Metabolic & energy\n                \n              \n                Toxins & heavy metals\n                \n              \n                Neurocognitive markers\n                \n              \n        \n  \n\n\n  \n    FAQFrequently asked questionsEverything you need to know before you order.See full FAQ\n\n    \n            What is the TruAge™ test, and how does it work?\n            TruAge™ analyzes your epigenetics through DNA methylation — chemical changes to your DNA that shift predictably with age and lifestyle — the same medical-grade technology used in leading academic aging studies. From a single blood spot sample, it calculates your biological age, your aging speed, and the age of 11 individual organ systems using algorithms developed with Harvard, Yale, and Duke.\n          \n            What is included in my TruAge™ test results?\n            TruAge™ shows you what your chronological age can't: how fast your body is actually aging, and where to focus. You'll see your overall biological age, your pace of aging, and organ-specific scores across 11 systems — plus personalized, science-backed recommendations you can act on. Retesting over time lets you see whether the changes you're making are actually working.\n          \n            Who should take TruAge™?\n            TruAge™ is built for adults who want a clear, data-driven picture of how they're aging — whether you're optimizing an existing health routine, working with a longevity-focused provider, or just curious how your lifestyle is showing up at the cellular level. No prescription or diagnosis required to take it.\n          \n            How accurate is TruAge™?\n            TruAge™ has a 98% test-retest reproducibility, meaning the same sample analyzed twice will return consistent results. The test is built on algorithms validated across more than 50 peer-reviewed publications, 80 academic collaborations, and over 100,000 processed samples.\n          \n            How often should I retest?\n            Because biological age responds to lifestyle changes, many customers retest every 3–6 months to track progress — which is why we offer a 4-test annual subscription at a discount over one-time purchases.\n          \n            Is TruAge™ HSA/FSA eligible?\n            Yes, TruAge™ qualifies for HSA/FSA reimbursement.\n          \n            How is my data protected?\n            Your sample and results are processed in a CLIA-certified lab and stored with industry-standard encryption and strict access controls.\n          \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      \n           Customer Reviews     4.48 out of 5 Based on 66 reviews           55           2           1           2           6   See all reviews \n  \n\nCustomer photos & videos  \n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n       87.5    Verified          \n  Sort by\n  \n    Most Recent\n    Highest Rating\n    Lowest Rating\n    Only Pictures\n    Pictures First\n    Videos First\n    Most Helpful\n  \n\n     8 months ago Hannah L.                       Love this test!!! Love this test!!! I take it every 3 months to help track my aging and epigenetic biomarkers from home. No need to go get vials and vials of blood drawn for 10 biomarkers. This test analyzes over 100 with a tiny amount of blood which has been so awesome and reliably consistent in helping me track my health.       Review collected via store invitation            1 year ago Kristina B.                     Amazing kit! TruAge Test was very amazing to check my DNA and everything about my health state that an ordinary or usual test could not detect. It gives me a report of health risk which from that I'll be able to manage from an early stage. The kit was sealed, and the direction is very straight forward. It has a complete paraphernalia form cotton to bandage.       Review collected from a store visitor            1 year ago Amber Malano                     Worth it! I am a functional medicine practitioner and see and run many of different types of lab testing. I was really thrilled with my experience of the TruAge test - it took 5 minutes to do the test and for the amount of results I received, it was pretty remarkable! Highly recommend this for optimizing health and worth it for the price point and amount of data you get from the results.             Review collected from a store visitor            1 year ago Xiane                     Next-Level Health Data—Thanks, TruDiagnostic! The experience was surprisingly simple and hassle-free, especially for someone like me who isn’t a fan of pricking or blood. The process was quick, efficient, and completely comfortable. I’m genuinely excited to receive my results. The science behind it is fascinating, and it’s reassuring to know that I’m getting data that can actually help me improve my health. It feels like a big step forward in how we approach medicine, and I’m excited to see what I can do with this information.  Huge thanks to TruDiagnostic for making this possible 🥳😁             Review collected from a store visitor            1 year ago Angela                     Exceptional Customer Service and Great Results! This TruAge testing kit was fantastic—simple process, fast results, and super detailed information. Their customer service was top-notch, always friendly and quick to assist. Highly recommended!       Review collected from a store visitor          123      \n      \n    \n    \n    \n  \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n      \n\n\n  \n\n    \n      \n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      About\n    \n    \n      About\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n        About UsFAQBlogCareers\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n  \n    \n      Partners\n    \n    \n      Partners\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n        Become a ProviderBecome an AffiliateResearch ServiceOur LaboratoryMedia RequestsAPI ReferenceSubscribe to our Longevity NewsletterRequisition Form\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n  \n    \n      Members\n    \n    \n      Members\n\n  \n\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n        Log InRegister My KitView My ReportsReturns & Refunds\n      \n    \n  \n\n\n  About\n  \n    About\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n      881 Corporate Dr.Lexington, KY 40503(888) 909-3634** Mon-Fri 9am-7pm | Sat 9am-3pm Eastern Time (UTC-5:00)support@trudiagnostic.com\n    \n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n      © 2026 TruDiagnostic™      Terms of Service      Privacy Policy     FCOI Policy\n    \n  \n\n\n\n    Powered by Shopify\n      \n    \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n        \n          \n        \n      \n    \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \"Close (esc)\"\n  \n\n\n\n  \n    \n    TruAge™ Test\n    \n    \n  \n\n\n  \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    x\n    \n    \n  \n\n\n  \n  \n\n    \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  Your Cart    Your cart is currently empty      Apply Promo Code                          Apply                            Total$0.00  Shipping + taxes calculated at checkout  Checkout\n","document":{"attributes":{"class":"js sc-hide-dcb","dir":"ltr","lang":"en","subframe":""},"children":[{"hidden":true,"tag":"head"},{"tag":"#text","text":"\n\n"},{"attributes":{"class":"template-product loaded","data-animate_buttons":"true","data-animate_images":"false","data-animate_images_style":"fade-in","data-animate_page_transition_style":"page-slide-reveal-down","data-animate_sections":"true","data-animate_underlines":"true","data-aos-delay":"0","data-aos-duration":"400","data-aos-easing":"ease-out-quad","data-transitions":"true","data-type_base_accent_transform":"true","data-type_header_accent_transform":"true","data-type_header_capitalize":"false","data-type_header_text_alignment":"true","style":"font-family: \"sans\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 75%"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n\n  \n    "},{"hidden":true,"tag":"script"},{"tag":"#text","text":"\n  \n\n  "},{"attributes":{"class":"in-page-link visually-hidden skip-link js-no-transition","href":"https://shop.trudiagnostic.com/products/truage-complete-epigenetic-collection#MainContent"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Skip to content"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"a"},{"tag":"#text","text":"\n\n  "},{"attributes":{"class":"page-container"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n    "},{"attr