-04T19:51:58Z"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"1 year ago"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"time"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-row-profile"},"children":[{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__icon"},"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__author-wrapper"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":" "},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__author"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Xiane"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"span"},{"tag":"#text","text":"   "}],"hidden":false,"tag":"span"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-row-extra"},"children":[{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__location"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"  "}],"hidden":false,"tag":"span"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"tag":"#text","text":"         "},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__br"},"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"tag":"#text","text":"   "}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"tag":"#text","text":" "},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__content"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"   "},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__title"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Next-Level Health Data—Thanks, TruDiagnostic!"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"b"},{"tag":"#text","text":" "},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__body"},"children":[{"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"The experience was surprisingly simple and hassle-free, especially for someone like me who isn’t a fan of pricking or blood. The process was quick, efficient, and completely comfortable. I’m genuinely excited to receive my results. The science behind it is fascinating, and it’s reassuring to know that I’m getting data that can actually help me improve my health. It feels like a big step forward in how we approach medicine, and I’m excited to see what I can do with this information.  Huge thanks to TruDiagnostic for making this possible 🥳😁"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"p"}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"attributes":{"class":"jdgm-rev__custom-form"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"  "}],"hidden":false,"tag":"div"},{"